  "storageGuide": "Taaza pump kiya hua doodh (CDC ki hidayat):\n• Kamra, 25°C ya kam: 4 ghante tak\n• Barf ke pack wala cooler bag: 24 ghante tak\n• Fridge: 4 din tak\n• Freezer: 6 mahine ke andar behtar, 12 mahine tak\n\nPighla hua doodh: fridge mein 24 ghante ke andar, ya garam karne ke baad 2 ghante ke andar istemal karein. Pighla hua doodh kabhi dobara freeze na karein.\nPilane ke baad bacha hua doodh: 2 ghante ke andar istemal karein, phir zaaya kar dein.\n\nPakistan ki garmiyon mein kamre aksar 25°C se zyada garam hote hain, is liye pump karne ke foran baad doodh fridge ya barf wale cooler mein rakhein.",
